msgstr ""
"Nämä ovat delegoituja tilirekisteröintejä, joista sinun on suoritettava "
"maksu."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"To confirm it, please pay the following amount as soon as possible: "
"%(amount)s."
msgstr ""
"Vahvistaaksesi sen, maksa seuraava summa mahdollisimman pian: %(amount)s."

msgid ""
"You have activated the following features, for each here's the links to "
